        </Exhibit/Pieces/Payload/OldSpot/Vase>: </Exhibit/Pieces/Payload/NewSpot/Vase>, 
        </Exhibit/Pieces/Variant/OldSpot/Vase>: </Exhibit/Pieces/Variant/NewSpot/Vase>, 
